.TH BIOKIDS\-PANEL 8 2026\-09\-30 "biokids 0.1.0" "BioKids"
.SH NAME
biokids\-panel \- BioKids parent panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B biokids\-panel
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR file ]
.RB [ \-\-port
.IR port ]
.RB [ \-\-log\-level
.IR level ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B biokids\-panel
serves the parent panel: the setup wizard, daily limits, the children's
applications and the audit log.
It runs as root under
.BR systemd (1)
as
.B biokids\-panel.service
and listens on the loopback address only, by default
.IR http://127.0.0.1:7878/ .
Another device reaches it through Tailscale, never through an open port.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " file"
Read the configuration from
.I file
instead of
.IR /etc/biokids/config.toml .
.TP
.BI \-\-host " address"
Override the bind address.
Only loopback addresses are accepted.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " port"
Override the port.
.TP
.BI \-\-log\-level " level"
One of debug, info, warning or error.
.TP
.B \-\-reload
Restart when the source changes.
For development only.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/biokids/config.toml
Machine configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/biokids/biokids.db
Settings, time history and the audit log.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR biokids\-admin (8),
.BR biokids\-daemon (8)
